Anteater Chess Alpha Source Release
Installation Instructions

1. Extract the source package:
   gtar xvzf Chess_Alpha_src.tar.gz

2. Change to the project directory:
   cd chess

3. Build the program:
   make

4. Run the unit tests:
   make test

5. Run the program:
   ./bin/chess

Optional commands:
- make clean
  Remove generated build files
- make tar
  Regenerate the source package archive

This source package is intended for a Linux environment with GNU Make
and a standard C toolchain installed.

For more details, please refer to:
- doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf
- doc/Chess_SoftwareSpec.pdf